<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23 pct, 3-mo 22.97 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 23 pct, 3-mo 22.97 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) remained unchanged for the one-month maturity and edged higher for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 23 percent while the three-month rate was fixed at 22.97 percent, up from 22.96 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
